<title>USA: Public Service Enterprise Group Inc Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Public Service Enterprise Group Inc Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.83		    $0.79</p>
<p> Net			192,814		  194,104</p>
<p> Revs		   1,732,552		1,797,245</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 232,072		  244,698</p>
<p>		     12 months</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.55		    $2.63</p>
<p> Net			610,306		  600,326</p>
<p> Revs		   5,976,556		6,061,115</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 239,281		  244,698</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call Q1 consensus estimate was $0.79.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 net was $185.5 million, or $0.76/shr, before profit from discontinued operations of $8.6 million, or $0.03/shr.</p>
<p>12 mth net included profits from discontinued operations of $2.1 million, or $0.01/shr, vs $43.5 million, or $0.18/shr. Latest 12 mths also included gain of $13.5 million, or $0.06/shr, on sale of those operations.</p>
<p>((-- Jim Brumm 212-859-1710.))</p>
